// are not opened. It fails only if the parent transcript is missing, a link,
// not a regular file, or the session cannot be listed; errors name base names
// only. On error there is nothing to apply.""","""// ReadDelta lists the session again (parent, subagents/, meta files, Lstat
// only) and reads what was appended since c. Files whose size did not change
// are not opened. It fails only if the session cannot be listed; errors name
// base names only, and on error there is nothing to apply. A parent that is
// missing, unreadable or not a regular file is not an error: the delta then
// carries an IssueOpenFailed on the parent (Full at tick 0, then Empty while
// it persists), which the caller must detect through the parent's FileIssue.
//
// Declared oracle gap (meta files): a meta file that cannot be read (chmod 000)
